<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- iPhones with ProMotion hold app rendering at 60 Hz unless the app asks; the stream is 120 fps
	     on those panels, so ask. iPads ignore this key. -->
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<!-- Export compliance: Sill uses no encryption but Apple's own, so uploads, TestFlight builds
	     included, skip the encryption questions. Look again before adding cipher code or a crypto
	     library of Sill's own (docs/app-store-metadata.md section 6). -->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>로컬 네트워크에서 Mac을 찾습니다.</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<!-- DEBUG ONLY: Info.plist (the Release configuration's) plus `_silltest._tcp`, which the Debug
	     build browses for with -SillServiceType _silltest._tcp: the simulator refuses a browse for
	     a type this list does not declare (-65555 NoAuth, docs/home-pairing-plan.md, H0's P5). A
	     key added to Info.plist goes here too; nothing else may differ. -->
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_sill._tcp</string>
		<string>_silltest._tcp</string>
	</array>
	<!-- Add a Mac: the embedded scanner reads the pairing code the Mac shows. -->
	<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>등록된 iPad 인증 키로 Mac 복귀 요청에 서명할 때 Face ID를 사용합니다.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Mac에 표시된 코드를 스캔하여 페어링합니다.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>받아쓰기 버튼을 누르면 iPad 마이크로 캔버스 설명을 기록합니다.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>말한 내용을 기기 내에서 캔버스 설명 문구로 변환합니다.</string>
	<!-- The official app owns external sill:// links. The embedded scanner reads them directly. -->
</dict>
</plist>
